        "data": {
          "comment": "# Write a Listing from the Product Photo\n\nWrites a marketplace listing from the product photo itself. Working from the image catches details a spec sheet leaves out, such as finish and proportion.\n\n**How it works:** Drop the photo into \"1 Photo\". \"2 Copywriter\" looks at it and writes a title under 70 characters and a description of about 80 words, without superlatives or invented specs. \"3 Listing\" returns the text.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a vision-capable model on \"2 Copywriter\" and change its prompt to ask for five bullet points instead."
